BAKR: We've got a problem, sir. Cobra One's weapons don't seem to be having any effect.

SHAW: How much longer on that transmission?

GRIG: [Off-mic, below Baker and Shaw] They're hitting us hard, sir, I don't know how much more of this we can take!

BAKR: Should just be a few minutes.

SHAW: Okay. Cobra One, I'm gonna put a Day Wrecker down on your location. Keep the Soviets at bay and do not move away until I say otherwise!